I recommend doing it on a PC, using a Mumu Player emulator, or directly on a PC.

here is: 

loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Habuui/FE2-TAS-Autoplay-script/refs/heads/main/TAS%20creator/TAScreator.lua', true))()

execute this in the executor, have fun :)

If you're good at the game and know how to work with TAS, record some TAS files for a few maps and send them to me. Whoever makes a TAS file for a map in record time will get a file in my keyframes folder :)
